          <a href="/#contacts"
             class="mt-7 mb-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-navy px-6 py-3 text-left text-base font-display font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#0b527b] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-steel focus-visible:ring-offset-2">Замовити
            нове обладнання          </a>
